            </note>
            <note corresp="#d33-f3" n="97" xml:id="d33-f3-content">
                <p>Chancellor of National Peking University and former Chinese Ambassador in the
                    United States.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d33-f4" n="98" xml:id="d33-f4-content">
                <p>A Communist representative on the People’s Political Council at Chungking,
                    1939–41.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
